Id: suid001a
Severity: ALERT
Category: filesystem
Check: check_suid

A setuid file elsewhere on the disk has the same contents as a known
system binary. Somebody copied a privileged program to an unexpected
place, which is what an intruder does to keep a back door after the
original is cleaned, or what a careless build leaves behind. Compare
the two files, find out who put the copy there, and remove it unless
there is a documented reason for it to exist.
